# Student Restrictions — Frontend Developer Reference & Postman Test Guide

---

## 🔗 API Endpoints

| # | Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|--------|----------|-------------|
| 1 | **POST** | `/api/college/add_student_restriction/:studentId` | Add restriction to a student |
| 2 | **GET** | `/api/college/get_all_restrictions?passout_year=2026` | List all restrictions (passout_year **required**) |
| 3 | **GET** | `/api/college/get_student_restrictions/:studentId` | Get restrictions for a specific student |
| 4 | **PATCH** | `/api/college/update_restriction/:restrictionId` | Resolve / update a restriction |

> **Auth**: All endpoints require JWT cookie from college admin/TPO login.

---

## 📝 API 1: Add Restriction

**`POST /api/college/add_student_restriction/:studentId`**

### Request Body

```json
{
  "restriction_type": "bar_from_placements",
  "reason": "Backed out after accepting offer from TCS without valid reason",
  "details": "Student accepted TCS offer on 15th Jan and then backed out on 20th Jan. This caused embarrassment to the college. Warning was given verbally first.",
  "valid_until": "2026-06-30"
}
```

### Fields

| Field | Type | Required | UI Element | Validation | Notes |
|-------|------|----------|------------|------------|-------|
| `restriction_type` | string | ✅ Yes | **Select Dropdown** | Must be one of the 5 types below | First field — determines severity |
| `reason` | string | ✅ Yes | **Textarea** (3-4 rows) | Min 5, Max 1000 chars | Why the restriction is being applied |
| `details` | string | ❌ No | **Textarea** (4-6 rows) | Max 2000 chars | Additional context, timeline, evidence |
| `valid_until` | date | ❌ No | **Date Picker** | Must be today or future | Leave empty for "until manually resolved" |

### Restriction Type Dropdown Options

| Value | Display Label | Description |
|-------|---------------|-------------|
| `bar_from_placements` | 🚫 Bar from All Placements | Student cannot apply to any company |
| `bar_from_company` | 🏢 Bar from Specific Company | Student barred from one company |
| `probation` | ⚠️ Probation | Under observation, can still apply |
| `warning` | 📋 Warning | Official warning on record |
| `temporary_suspension` | ⏸️ Temporary Suspension | Suspended from placement activities |

### Success Response (201)

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Student restriction applied",
  "data": {
    "restriction_id": "a1b2c3d4-...",
    "student_id": "s1t2u3d4-...",
    "student_name": "Rahul Patil",
    "student_email": "rahul@college.edu",
    "dept_name": "Computer Engineering",
    "student_passout_year": 2026,
    "restriction_type": "bar_from_placements",
    "reason": "Backed out after accepting offer from TCS without valid reason",
    "details": "Student accepted TCS offer on 15th Jan...",
    "restricted_by": "u1s2e3r4-...",
    "restricted_by_name": "Prof. Sharma",
    "applied_on": "2026-03-01",
    "valid_until": "2026-06-30",
    "is_active": true,
    "appeal_submitted": false,
    "appeal_notes": null,
    "resolved_by": null,
    "resolved_by_name": null,
    "created_at": "2026-03-01T18:00:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-01T18:00:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

### Error Cases

| Status | When | Message |
|--------|------|---------|
| 404 | Student not found | "Student not found" |
| 409 | Duplicate active restriction of same type | "Student already has an active \"bar_from_placements\" restriction" |
| 400 | `valid_until` is in the past | "Valid until date must be today or in the future" |
| 422 | Validation failure | Field-level error details |

---

## 📝 API 2: List All Restrictions

**`GET /api/college/get_all_restrictions`**

### Query Parameters

| Param | Type | Required | Default | Notes |
|-------|------|----------|---------|-------|
| `passout_year` | integer | ✅ Yes | — | **Must be passed** — filters by student's passout year |
| `restriction_type` | string | ❌ No | all | Filter by type dropdown |
| `is_active` | boolean | ❌ No | all | `true` = active only, `false` = resolved only |
| `search` | string | ❌ No | — | Search by student name or email |
| `page` | integer | ❌ No | 1 | Pagination |
| `limit` | integer | ❌ No | 20 | Max 100 |

### Example Request

```
GET /api/college/get_all_restrictions?passout_year=2026&is_active=true&page=1&limit=20
```

### Success Response (200)

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Restrictions retrieved successfully",
  "data": [
    {
      "restriction_id": "a1b2c3d4-...",
      "student_id": "s1t2u3d4-...",
      "student_name": "Rahul Patil",
      "student_email": "rahul@college.edu",
      "dept_name": "Computer Engineering",
      "student_passout_year": 2026,
      "restriction_type": "bar_from_placements",
      "reason": "Backed out after accepting TCS offer",
      "details": "...",
      "restricted_by_name": "Prof. Sharma",
      "applied_on": "2026-03-01",
      "valid_until": "2026-06-30",
      "is_active": true,
      "appeal_submitted": false,
      "resolved_by_name": null,
      "created_at": "2026-03-01T18:00:00.000Z"
    }
  ],
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 20,
    "total": 3,
    "totalPages": 1
  }
}
```

### Frontend UI Notes

- **Year selector dropdown** at the top of the page (like student list) — this is the `passout_year` param
- Default to `college.default_academic_year`
- **Filter bar**: restriction_type dropdown + is_active toggle + search input
- **Table columns**: Student Name, Email, Dept, Type (badge), Reason (truncated), Applied On, Valid Until, Status (Active/Resolved badge), Actions

