## 🧪 Postman Test Data

### Setup
- Login as college admin first: `POST /api/college/login`
- Cookie `token` will be set automatically
- You need a valid `studentId` from your college

---

### Test 1: Add Restriction (Bar from Placements)

```
POST /api/college/add_student_restriction/<studentId>
Content-Type: application/json
```

```json
{
  "restriction_type": "bar_from_placements",
  "reason": "Backed out after accepting TCS offer without informing the placement cell",
  "details": "The student accepted the offer letter on January 15th and then refused to join on January 28th. This caused loss of the placement slot for the college.",
  "valid_until": "2026-06-30"
}
```

