  "is_active": false
}
```

### Test 12: Extend Restriction

```
PATCH /api/college/update_restriction/<restrictionId>
Content-Type: application/json
```

```json
{
  "valid_until": "2026-12-31"
}
```

### Test 13: Update Reason

```
PATCH /api/college/update_restriction/<restrictionId>
Content-Type: application/json
```

```json
{
  "reason": "Reduced severity: Student apologized and submitted written explanation",
  "details": "After review meeting on March 5th, the committee decided to reduce the restriction severity. Student submitted a written apology letter."
}
```

### Test 14: Validation Error — Missing Required Field

```
POST /api/college/add_student_restriction/<studentId>
Content-Type: application/json
```

```json
{
  "restriction_type": "bar_from_placements"
}
```

Expected: `422` with `"Reason for restriction is required"`

### Test 15: Duplicate Restriction Error

Send the same Test 1 request again with the same studentId.

Expected: `409` with `"Student already has an active \"bar_from_placements\" restriction"`

